[0.090, "o", "BLOCKED: version-sentinel.\r\nPackage: lodash (npm). Version: 4.17.21.\r\nNo fresh version check on record (window: 24h).\r\n\r\nREQUIRED before retry:\r\n1. Run WebSearch (or WebFetch / context7) for the latest version of \"lodash\" on the npm registry.\r\n2. Invoke /vs-record lodash <latest-version-from-result> <source-url>\r\n3. Retry your edit/install.\r\n\r\nEscape: if this pin is intentional (CVE lock, compat constraint, private registry, no-WebSearch region),\r\nrun: /vs-record lodash 4.17.21 \"intentional: <reason>\"\r\n---\r\n\r\n"]
